The
2026-27 Registration Form
can be used by team advisors (not students!) to register teams and to purchase downloadable collections of previous years' contests. The previous contests are a great resource to help prepare students. The deadline for registering for the season is December 31, 2026.
The fee to register each team is $175 (Senior, Intermediate, Junior, and Classroom divisions); $125 for Elementary division teams. Teams are based on either the top 5 scores in that contest, or the top 3 scores in that contest. A 5-score team is limited to 10 students on its roster; a 3-score team is limited to 6 students on its roster.
Teams can start test preparation anytime by using the materials and links from our
Study Materials
page.
